2. Executive Summary

Klaud provides specialized VMware Cloud Foundation, private cloud, and advanced infrastructure consulting services for technology partners across Latin America and Brazil.

This catalog is designed for partners who have strong customer relationships, commercial reach, and project opportunities, but require access to senior-level technical expertise to design, deploy, migrate, upgrade, or stabilize complex VMware environments. Klaud acts as a specialist delivery partner, helping partners expand their VMware service capabilities without needing to maintain a full in-house team of highly specialized architects and engineers.

Our services are focused on high-value infrastructure areas such as VMware Cloud Foundation, vSphere, vSAN, NSX, VCF Operations, VCF Automation, VMware Kubernetes Service, disaster recovery, security, lifecycle management, and hybrid cloud modernization.

Klaud can support partners in different ways depending on the opportunity. We can work behind the scenes as a white-label technical team, collaborate directly with the partner’s delivery resources, or participate as a named specialist when additional credibility is required for complex projects. In all cases, the partner maintains ownership of the customer relationship while Klaud provides the technical depth required to deliver successfully.

This catalog presents three commercial models:

On-Demand Hourly Services
A flexible time-and-materials model for advisory work, troubleshooting, pre-sales support, technical reviews, small tasks, or initial partner engagements.
Fixed-Price Service Bundles
Scope-based professional service packages for VCF deployments, upgrades, migrations, assessments, and advanced add-ons. This model provides predictable pricing and clear deliverables.
Partner Expert Capacity Plans
A prepaid expert-hours model that gives partners access to Klaud’s specialist resources over a defined period, without the need to negotiate each activity separately.

The objective of this pricing catalog is to make it easier for partners to include Klaud’s services in their commercial proposals, protect delivery quality, and improve project profitability. By working with Klaud, partners can pursue more advanced VMware opportunities, reduce delivery risk, accelerate project execution, and provide customers with a higher level of technical confidence.

All pricing in this document is partner net pricing and is intended for qualified partners only. It is not designed as an end-customer-facing price list. Final pricing and scope are subject to validation based on the customer environment, technical requirements, project complexity, timeline, and delivery assumptions.